    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-300">Docs</p>
    <h1
      class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-7xl"
    >
      Sheriff documentation.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
      Installation, configuration and policy examples will live here.
    </p>
